r/evaluator confirms the filter cancels poll issuance when the expression is not true and still reschedules the next tick. templates_test.go verifies both rendered triggers contain the visibility gate. Fast-forward from origin/master fbb9338 is verified; no blocking findings.\",\"time\":\"2026-09-04T18:45:43Z\"}\n\n=== d0c2f4812d3f0a66dcfa43888527ac9953752ffd ===\n{\"schema\": \"forest.verdict.v1\", \"revision\": \"c203dc9118ace7575d8aab1162f11edc2e3b601a\", \"verdict\": \"approve\", \"summary\": \"Checks passed (go test ./... and go vet ./...). Test-only revision adds coverage for audit divergence stale override rendering: divergent pass/trusted render class stale with the result text, while equal or missing revision pairs retain the ok class. Verified against auditView in view.go and by running the new subtests; revision is one commit ahead of origin/master and fast-forwards cleanly.\", \"time\": \"2026-09-04T19:28:49Z\"}\n\n=== 4ce6f00dd55b995475e196c4b7657b8c21eee357 ===\n{\"schema\":\"forest.verdict.v1\",\"revision\":\"08955b8839d45c3181286c798280f9f2d3aa422e\",\"verdict\":\"changes\",\"summary\":\"Stale revision: 08955b8 does not contain origin/master (73d1489 'fix(canopy): derive freshness window from collection cycle budget'); git merge-base --is-ancestor origin/master 08955b8 fails (merge-base=674894f). Fast-forward would delete 362 lines of freshness_test.go and revert app.go/view.go from master. Own diff (collector_test.go +118/-4) adds valid envelope schema/malformed-rejection tests; test+vet checks pass (exit 0). Rebase onto origin/master before approval.\",\"time\":\"2026-09-04T20:01:23Z\"}\n\n=== a3f9a5756d3778e64412ad9abe38028f3155bf6b ===\n{\"schema\":\"forest.verdict.v1\",\"revision\":\"674894f979ce78f3092027edac01eccfdf21f53a\",\"verdict\":\"approve\",\"summary\":\"Test-only revision adds table-driven coverage for instance param validation across all read routes and run param validation skipping the collector on bad input. No production code changed. Checks: go test ./... exit 0, go vet ./... exit 0. Ancestry holds against origin/master.\",\"time\":\"2026-09-04T19:40:16Z\"}\n\n"}],"details":{}}}
